  "A four-sublayer website architecture — manifest, corpus, capability, governance — that lets AI, agents, and crawlers correctly ingest, cite, invoke, and verify a site's knowledge.": "Kapangidwe ka tsamba ka magawo anayi ang'onoang'ono — manifest, corpus (gulu la zolemba), kuthekera, ndi ulamuliro — komwe kumalola AI, ma-ejenti, ndi ma-crawler kutenga, kutchula gwero, kuyitanitsa, ndi kutsimikizira chidziwitso cha tsambali moyenera.",
