  "A machine-readable specification layer for declaring AI content rights and licensing workflows — from AI crawling and content rights to a machine-transactable knowledge web.": "Gawo la mafotokozedwe owerengeka ndi makina la kulengeza ufulu wa zolemba za AI ndi njira za layisensi — kuyambira kuyenda kwa AI (crawling) ndi ufulu wa zolemba, mpaka intaneti ya chidziwitso yomwe makina angathe kuchitapo malonda.",
