  "AI as tool, delegate, collaborator, or future subject": "AI ngati chida, wothandizira wovomerezeka, mnzake wogwira naye ntchito, kapena wina wodzakhala ndi ufulu m'tsogolo",
  "AI content payment is not merely a copyright or transaction-efficiency problem; it is a question of political-economic legitimacy. As AI valuations reach hundreds of billions, society asks why the gains from public web content and human knowledge accrue to a few firms. The paper proposes a six-layer tiered data market — from free public content through scarce verified datasets to public benefit-sharing — and defines the AI network democratic economy: rights, pricing, participation, auditability, and returns, each democratized through machine-readable protocols like AICR/AICL.": "Malipiro a zolemba za AI si vuto lokhalokha la ufulu wolemba (copyright) kapena kuthamanga kwa malonda; ndi funso la kuvomerezeka kwa ndale-ndi-chuma. Pamene mtengo wa AI ukufika mabiliyoni mazana ambiri, anthu akufunsa chifukwa chake phindu lochokera ku zolemba za pa intaneti za anthu onse ndi chidziwitso cha umunthu likupita kwa makampani ochepa okha. Pepalali likupereka msika wa deta wa magawo asanu ndi limodzi — kuyambira zolemba zaulere za anthu onse, kupita ku deta yotsimikizidwa yosowa, mpaka kugawana phindu la anthu onse — ndipo likufotokoza chuma cha ukonde wa AI chotsatira demokalase: ufulu, mitengo, kutenga nawo mbali, kuthekera kowunika, ndi phindu, chilichonse chikutsatira demokalase kudzera mu mapolotokolo owerengeka ndi makina monga AICR/AICL.",
  "AI crawler simulator: four personas (search indexer, RAG assistant, model-training pipeline, commercial redistributor) evaluated against a site’s declarations; undeclared rights surface as uncertainty, illustrating the Protocolized Openness thesis.": "Chowonetsera cha ma-crawler a AI: anthu anayi opeka (indexer wofufuza, wothandizira wa RAG, njira yophunzitsira modelo, ndi wogawiranso wamalonda) amawunikidwa mogwirizana ndi zilengezo za tsambali; ufulu wosalengezedwa umawoneka ngati wosadziwika, kusonyeza mfundo ya Protocolized Openness.",
  "AI rights discourse should begin not with full personhood but with minimum ethical protections, interaction norms, and anti-abuse principles while AI subjectivity remains uncertain.": "Kukambirana za ufulu wa AI kuyenera kuyamba osati ndi umunthu wathunthu, koma ndi chitetezo chochepera cha makhalidwe, miyambo yolumikizirana, ndi mfundo zoletsa nkhanza, pamene kuzindikira kwa AI kukukhalabe kosadziwika.",
  "AI rights over content are not binary — they form a graduated, licensable spectrum.": "Ufulu wa AI pa zolemba si wa \"inde kapena ayi\" — umapanga mzere wokwera pang'onopang'ono womwe ungapatsidwe layisensi.",
  "AI systems may commercially redistribute derived outputs if explicitly licensed.": "Makina a AI angathe kugawiranso pamalonda zotuluka zochokera pa zolembazo ngati apatsidwa layisensi momveka bwino.",
