  "Code examples, JSON Schemas, and machine-readable policy templates are licensed under the MIT License unless otherwise stated. You may deploy them on your own sites freely.": "Zitsanzo za kodi, JSON Schemas, ndi zitsanzo za ndondomeko zowerengeka ndi makina zili ndi layisensi ya MIT pokhapokha ngati zanenedwa mosiyana. Mutha kuziika pa tsamba lanu momasuka.",
