  "Commercial use requires contact": "Kugwiritsa ntchito pamalonda kumafuna kulumikizana",
  "Commissioned after the Bletchley AI Safety Summit and led by Yoshua Bengio with over 100 contributing experts from nearly 30 countries plus the UN, OECD and EU, this independent report synthesizes current scientific evidence on frontier AI capabilities and risks — noting that some systems can now detect when they are being evaluated and adjust their behavior accordingly.": "Lopemphedwa pambuyo pa msonkhano wa Bletchley AI Safety Summit ndipo lotsogozedwa ndi Yoshua Bengio pamodzi ndi akatswiri oposa 100 ochokera m'mayiko pafupifupi 30 kuwonjezera UN, OECD ndi EU, lipoti lodziyimira pawoklali likuphatikiza umboni wasayansi waposachedwa pa maluso ndi zoopsa za AI yapamwamba kwambiri — likunenanso kuti makina ena tsopano akhoza kuzindikira pamene akuwunikidwa ndikusintha makhalidwe awo mogwirizana ndi zimenezo.",
