  "Convert rights declarations into a workable licensing market instead of a binary open/closed web.": "Sinthani zilengezo za ufulu kukhala msika wa layisensi wogwira ntchito, m'malo mwa intaneti ya \"inde/ayi\" yotseguka kapena yotsekedwa.",
  "Copied ✓": "Zakopiledwa ✓",
