  "Correct positioning: independent research drafts, protocol proposals, and an open specification experiment.": "Kuikidwa moyenera: zikalata za kafukufuku wodziyimira pawokha, malingaliro a mapolotokolo, ndi kuyesa kwa mafotokozedwe otseguka.",
  "Corrected an earlier default: Belgium (BE) now maps to Dutch instead of French — Flemish speakers are the country’s majority (~60%) over Walloon French speakers (~40%).": "Takonza cholakwika choyambirira: Belgium (BE) tsopano ikuloza ku Chidatchi m'malo mwa Chifalansa — olankhula Chiflemish ndiwo ambiri m'dzikoli (~60%) poyerekeza ndi olankhula Chifalansa cha Wallon (~40%).",
  "Corrected an earlier default: Kazakhstan (KZ) now maps to Kazakh instead of Russian, now that a Kazakh translation exists — the same kind of fix as the earlier Belgium correction.": "Takonza cholakwika choyambirira: Kazakhstan (KZ) tsopano ikuloza ku Chikazakh m'malo mwa Chirasha, popeza pali tsopano Chikazakh chomasuliridwa — mtundu womwewo wa kukonza ngati kukonza kwa Belgium koyambirira.",
  "Could AI Be Conscious?": "Could AI Be Conscious?",
  "Crawler access rules": "Malamulo a Kufikira kwa Crawler",
