  "Transform": "Kusintha",
  "Transformation": "Kusintha Kwathunthu",
  "Turns declared rights into executable licensing: quote, pay, verify, audit, revoke.": "Kusandutsa ufulu wolengezedwa kukhala layisensi yogwiritsika ntchito: chiwerengero cha mtengo, kulipira, kutsimikizira, kuwunika, kuchotsa.",
  "Twenty languages live in total: English, Traditional Chinese, Simplified Chinese, Japanese, Korean, French, German, Spanish, Portuguese, Russian, Arabic, Turkish, Persian, Bengali, Hindi, Indonesian, Vietnamese, Greek, Italian, Dutch.": "Zilankhulo makumi awiri zonse zikugwira ntchito: Chingerezi, Chitchaina Chachikhalidwe, Chitchaina Chosavuta, Chijapani, Chikorea, Chifalansa, Chijeremani, Chisipanishi, Chipwitikizi, Chirasha, Chiarabu, Chituruki, Chiperisiya, Chibengali, Chihindi, Chiindonesia, Chivietinamu, Chigiriki, Chitaliyana, Chidatchi.",
  "Two license tiers: a free public tier and a contact-based commercial tier.": "Magulu awiri a layisensi: gulu laulere la anthu onse ndi gulu la malonda lofuna kulumikizana.",
  "UI": "UI",
  "Undefined openness reads as legal uncertainty to AI pipelines and gets cleaned out; only protocolized, machine-readable permission makes content genuinely learnable.": "Kutseguka kosafotokozedwa kumawerengedwa ngati kusadziwika kwalamulo m'njira za AI ndipo kumachotsedwa; chilolezo chokhazikitsidwa m'mapolotokolo, chowerengeka ndi makina chokha ndicho chimapangitsa zolemba kuphunzirika kwenikweni.",
