  "Validate": "Tsimikizirani",
  "Validator": "Validator",
  "Verified dataset markets and collective licensing": "Misika ya Deta Yotsimikizidwa ndi Layisensi Yagulu",
  "Verified in both LTR and RTL contexts: the panel mirrors correctly for Arabic and Persian without any special-casing, using logical CSS positioning.": "Zatsimikizidwa mu mikhalidwe yonse iwiri ya LTR ndi RTL: bokosilo limasinthasintha bwinobwino kwa Chiarabu ndi Chiperisiya popanda kusintha kwapadera, pogwiritsa ntchito malo a logical CSS.",
  "Verify": "Tsimikizirani",
  "Version history of this site and its protocol drafts.": "Mbiri ya Mavasioni a Tsambali ndi Zikalata Zake za Mapolotokolo.",
  "Version history of this site and its protocol drafts. Breaking spec changes are recorded here.": "Mbiri ya mavasioni a tsambali ndi zikalata zake za mapolotokolo. Kusintha kwakukulu kwa mafotokozedwe kumalembedwa pano.",
  "Versioned specifications, JSON Schemas, and the policy files actually deployed on this site. Every file can be downloaded, validated, and cited directly.": "Mafotokozedwe a mavasioni osiyanasiyana, JSON Schemas, ndi mafayilo a ndondomeko omwe adaikidwa kwenikweni pa tsambali. Fayilo iliyonse ingatsitsidwe, kutsimikizidwa, ndi kutchulidwa mwachindunji.",
  "Versioning": "Kusintha kwa Mavasioni",
  "Versions": "Mavasioni",
  "Video and audio companions to the protocols and papers — the AI rights layer, watchable and listenable.": "Mavidiyo ndi mawu othandizira mapolotokolo ndi mapepala — gawo la ufulu wa AI, logwira lomwe mungawaonere ndi kumvera.",
  "Videos": "Mavidiyo",
  "Want to generate your own policy file?": "Kodi mukufuna kupanga fayilo yanu ya ndondomeko?",
  "Web fonts are loaded from Google Fonts, which receives standard font requests from your browser. No other third-party scripts are used.": "Mafonti a tsambali amatengedwa kuchokera ku Google Fonts, yomwe imalandira mapempho achizolowezi a fonti kuchokera ku browser yanu. Palibe pulogalamu ina ya munthu wachitatu yomwe imagwiritsidwa ntchito.",
  "What AI systems may do with content: read, summarize, transform, retrieve, train, commercialize, redistribute. The AICR ruleset and the AICL licensing layer make these rights declarable and transactable.": "Zomwe makina a AI angachite ndi zolemba: kuwerenga, kufotokoza mwachidule, kusintha, kutulutsa, kuphunzitsa, kugwiritsa ntchito pamalonda, kugawiranso. Malamulo a AICR ndi gawo la layisensi la AICL zimapangitsa ufulu umenewu kukhala wolengezeka ndi wogwiritsika ntchito pa malonda.",
  "What a server can return when an AI crawler requests licensed content without a license token — a machine-actionable quote instead of a dead end.": "Chomwe seva ingabweretse pamene crawler ya AI ikupempha zolemba za layisensi popanda tokeni ya layisensi — chiwerengero cha mtengo chomwe makina angathe kugwiritsa ntchito m'malo mwa chithero.",
  "What this site is": "Chimene Tsambali Ndicho",
  "What this site is not": "Chimene Tsambali Sichili",
  "When The Machines Deserve Our Consideration": "When The Machines Deserve Our Consideration",
  "Whether AI may learn, to what depth, for which purposes, and under what obligations. Being read is not being learned from; \"not prohibited\" is not \"learnable\". AIRS and AILP turn learning permission into a graduated, machine-readable spectrum.": "Ngati AI angaphunzire, kuya kotani, pa zolinga zotani, ndi maudindo otani. Kuwerengedwa si kuphunziridwa; \"kusaletsedwa\" si \"kuphunzirika\". AIRS ndi AILP zimasandutsa chilolezo chophunzira kukhala mzere wokwera pang'onopang'ono, wowerengeka ndi makina.",
  "Whitepapers": "Mabuku Oyera",
  "Whitepapers & Docs": "Mabuku Oyera ndi Zikalata",
  "Whitepapers remain English-first by design; machine-readable files stay language-neutral.": "Mabuku oyera amakhalabe a Chingerezi poyamba mwadala; mafayilo owerengeka ndi makina amakhalabe osalowerera pa chilankhulo.",
  "Who is behind it": "Ndani Ali Mmbuyo Mwake",
  "Why AI Needs Minimum Ethical Protections": "Why AI Needs Minimum Ethical Protections",
  "Why AI might not gain moral standing: Lessons from animal ethics": "Why AI might not gain moral standing: Lessons from animal ethics",
  "Why a single allow/deny bit cannot govern AI-era content use — and what a rights layer looks like instead.": "Chifukwa chake chizindikiro chimodzi cha \"loledwa/loletsedwa\" sichingalamulire kagwiritsidwe ntchito ka zolemba mu nyengo ya AI — ndiponso mmene gawo la ufulu limaonekera m'malo mwake.",
  "Why undefined openness gets cleaned out of training pipelines": "Chifukwa chake kutseguka kosafotokozedwa kumachotsedwa m'njira zophunzitsira",
  "Wilks, Ladak, and Loughnan (University of Edinburgh) argue that philosophical debate over AI consciousness overlooks psychological research on animal ethics — the same cognitive and social biases that limit moral consideration for animals will likely limit it for AI too, regardless of whether AI ever becomes conscious.": "Wilks, Ladak, ndi Loughnan (a ku University of Edinburgh) akunena kuti mkangano wa filosofi pa kuzindikira kwa AI ukunyalanyaza kafukufuku wa psychology pa makhalidwe okhudza nyama — makhalidwe omwewo a maganizo ndi a anthu omwe amachepetsa kuganizira makhalidwe kwa nyama mwina adzachepetsanso kwa AI, kaya AI idzakhala ndi kuzindikira kapena ayi.",
  "You are leaving AGIRight.org": "Mukuchoka pa AGIRight.org",
