  "“AICL: AI Ingestion & Capability Layer” now published in English as the canonical edition; the Chinese original manuscript remains available and both versions cross-link.": "“AICL: AI Ingestion & Capability Layer” yasindikizidwa tsopano mu Chingerezi ngati mtundu wovomerezeka; chikalata choyambirira cha Chitchaina chikupezekabe ndipo mitundu yonse iwiri ikulumikizana.",
  "“Protocolized Openness” confirmed as an English-language paper (with Chinese parallel passages) — no separate translation planned.": "“Protocolized Openness” yatsimikizidwa kukhala pepala la chinenero cha Chingerezi (pamodzi ndi ziganizo zofanana za Chitchaina) — palibe chomasulira china chokonzedwa.",
